Commit message:
    feat(api): GET /signals/catalog + /signals/observations

    Phase-43a / Prompt 0007 restores the two endpoints deleted by Phase-42
    prompt 0077. Frontend hooks useSignalCatalog + useSignalObservations
    stop returning 404.

    Catalog spine comes from routing.yaml (parsed once at handler
    construction via router.Load). Aggregates + observations come from
    signal_log (mig 000186). The catalog merges entries with aggregates
    in Go so routed-but-unobserved fields appear with last_seen_at=null
    and the count fields=null.

    Observations endpoint supports optional vehicle_id, field, since,
    until, limit, offset filters (all snake_case, csv multi-value where
    applicable). Default limit 100, max 1000 with structured {error,max,
    code} envelope on overflow. Value rendering picks the populated
    typed column from signal_log per the value_kind discriminator (per
    mig 000186 lines 79-89) and emits ValueKind.String() as value_kind.

    Both routes carry httprate.LimitByIP(60, 1*time.Minute) admin-tier
    rate limit (matches /vehicle-states + /mileage + /system/queues
    precedent). Mounted before /signals/{vehicleID} so the static paths
    take precedence under chi v5's longest-static-prefix matching.

